{"about_the_game":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778880/extras/Untitled__20_.png?t=1743788549\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Sword of Shadow: Revolution</h2> is an urban planning simulator with elements of survival, the action takes place on planet earth on a piece of once warm country, but after the disaster everything became completely different ...<br>You have to take on the role of commander of the settlement and begin to rebuild a new city, village, towns, cope with the shortage your people have food, because the cold does not spare anyone.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778880/extras/Untitled__19_.png?t=1743788549\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unique features</h2><br><strong>- Technology Branch</strong><br><br><strong>- Various variations of buildings and structures</strong><br><br><strong>- Various emotions and conditions of the townspeople</strong><br><br><strong>- Create clothes and other items </strong><br><br><strong>- Improve the quality of life through the development of citizens</strong><br><br><strong>- Train and equip them for protection</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Construction system</h2><br><strong>Build structures on a piece of land to expand your settlement, improve people's buildings to support life and remember - the cold does not spare anyone.</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Create a new future with Sword of Shadow: Revolution.</h2><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778880/extras/Untitled__18_.png?t=1743788549\" />","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1778880?t=1743788549","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778880/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743788549","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778880/9ffe781971f89e9df17d4544a4bf